  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging the positive impact of migration on Moldova&#x2019;s development through improved policy evidence and better engaged diaspora</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Programme is to leverage the positive impact of migration on Moldova&#x2019;s socio-economic development and minimize the negative effects of migration. The goals will be achieved by strengthening the capacities of relevant public authorities for ensuring an effective country&#x2019;s migration policy design and management, and through employment of innovative instruments for better engagement of the highly skilled diaspora in country&#x2019;s development.</narrative>
  </description>
